{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy this file to .pii-identities.local.json and replace the contents with the",
    "real names you need kept out of this repo. The copy is gitignored and must never",
    "be committed — a gate that lists five customers in order to keep them out of a",
    "public repo publishes those five customers.",
    "",
    "`identities` are company or person names. Each becomes a word-boundary match,",
    "which also catches the name inside an address at that company's own domain.",
    "",
    "`trackers` are issue-tracker repositories. Each matches `<name>/issues/123` and",
    "`<name>#123`.",
    "",
    "The names below are fictional and are here so that a clone with no real list",
    "still runs a gate that scans for something. test/pov-plugin.test.ts asserts this",
    "file is non-empty and that none of its names appear in the real list."
  ],
  "identities": [
    "Initech",
    "Globex Corporation",
    "Umbrella Industries"
  ],
  "trackers": [
    "acme/internal-tracker"
  ]
}
